@the-real-things Definitely, cameras with smaller sensors really struggle at night. The vertical camera shake is more noticeable and light sources tend to blur. 

That said, using a Z-axis stabilizer makes a huge difference! I actually tested this with the Pocket 3 and it improved the footage a lot, so definitely give it a try if you get the chance! 

Thanks again and hope to see you back on the channel soon! 📷✨

